{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.natsuha.bench",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "她递来一罐咖啡",
  "status": "review",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.natsuha.bench",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.natsuha.bench",
    "idolId": "natsuha",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（今天的外勤到此为止。回事务所一趟吧。）",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯……夏葉，今天也在训练？",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "哎呀，制作人。呼……当然是这样。",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "明明前阵子才刚拿下 W.I.N.G. 冠军，真的很佩服夏葉。",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "就算夺冠，要做的事也不会变。",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈，是啊。不愧是夏葉。",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "其实我也不觉得自己在做什么特别的事……对了。",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "制作人，能不能在那边的长凳上等我一下？",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "可以是可以，怎么了？",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "别问了，制作人就慢慢休息吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，知道了。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "来，饮料。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "可以吗？谢谢你，夏葉。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "没关系。咖啡可以吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，完全没问题。不过说起来，一般该是我去拿吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "没事。这种时候就让我请一次吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "我可以坐你旁边吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，当然。",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "那，失礼了。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "……谢谢你，制作人。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，我做了什么吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "真是的，你一直都在支持我不是吗。托你的福，我才能拿下 W.I.N.G. 冠军。",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "真的，感谢你。说有今天的我，是因为你在，也不为过哦。",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哦、哦哦……",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "……怎么了制作人，呆住了？",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不……抱歉，这样冷不防被郑重地道谢，有点受不了。",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "真失礼。我道谢还是会道的哦。",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "而且，只是想说说，今后也请多指教而已。",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，当然。我这边才是，今后也请多指教。刚才也收到了道谢……",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "哎呀，那种不算道谢哦？",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶，是吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "是啊……那下次，我招待你去能看见漂亮夜景的、我喜欢的法餐厅吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "到时候，好好谈一谈吧？……为了站上更完美、更大的舞台，的计划。"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
  "createdAt": "2026-11-02T08:00:00.000Z",
